# Applies to every image built from this repo root (apps/*/Dockerfile all use
# the repo root as their build context — a pnpm workspace install needs every
# package.json, which means the context can't be scoped to one app directory).
#
# Keep this in sync with .gitignore's intent: anything that shouldn't be in
# git shouldn't be in a build context either, plus the local-only state below
# that IS gitignored but would otherwise still get copied into the image and
# silently shadow what the container generates fresh.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never bake real secrets into an image layer. Production config arrives as
# injected environment variables (compose.prod.yaml / the orchestrator), never
# a file baked into the build.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github

# Local dev state that has no meaning inside a container.
**/coverage
**/.vitest-cache
*.log

# Editor/OS noise.
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Documentation-only — never affects a running service, and excluding it means
# an ai/*.md edit doesn't bust every image's layer cache.
ai
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
